 "note": "RPCS3 Core 933 = Core 932 plus the local profile of a game and its first learned decision (maintainer audit of 11 Nov 2026, priority 3; docs/rpcs3-core933-profil-local.md): config/local_profiles/<serial>.txt keyed by serial and game version, bounded and written atomically when a decision is learned, withdrawn or validated (first three times), read before the title policy, ignored and replaced for another version or an unreadable file (REWINDBOX_LOCAL_PROFILE_933); in Automatic only, a title outside the Core 616/634 list runs the SPU object prefetch from its next boot once a window of play spent at least 500 ms reading at least 200 cached SPU objects, mostly for compiles of play, validated by 500 objects served from memory, withdrawn after two minutes of play below 1 % of the planned objects; the first window of a report session is not used (REWINDBOX_LEARNED_PREFETCH_933). The user's setting always wins. Core 932 unchanged otherwise. Replaces the Core 932 pin directly (Core 929 kept as the fallback in docs/evidence/rpcs3-core929). No codegen input changes: PPU and SPU codegen identities unchanged. MoltenVK dependency of run 42998604606 (libMoltenVK.a d19d3a42). Built by the RPCS3 Core route (run 43077626247, attempt 1, source bbef3768; Apple host harnesses run 43077626247 on bbef3768). Verified offline on the downloaded artifacts with the repository verifier (pin_errors and bundle); the packaged library holds the 933 boot and report lines and the profile format. Not measured on the iPhone; no energy, temperature or FPS claim.",
